<h2>11. Estimated Effort</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Beginner developer:</strong> 1-2 weeks (will need to learn basic SQL)</li>
<li><strong>Experienced developer:</strong> 2-4 days</li>
<li><strong>Hiring a developer:</strong> ~$500-2000 USD</li>
</ul>

<div class="warn"><strong>Important:</strong> If you're not comfortable with SQL, Firebase may be easier to start with. However, once you need complex queries (which this app does), Supabase will save you significant time and money in the long run.</div>

